{"channelId":"UCY-Zgb2m_iGyZrSxSfoj3Uw","row":["Animal Rescue Mission",1160,"Welcome to Animal Rescue Mission. 🐾\n\nWe bring abandoned dogs and cats back to life through powerful, cinematic rescue stories inspired by real-world events. Using advanced AI storytelling, we shine a light on the voiceless.\n\nOn this channel, you will witness: 💔 The heartbreak of pets left behind in the rain, cold, and silence. ❤️‍🩹 The turning point where compassion meets action. 🏡 The beautiful journey from loneliness to a forever home.\n\nOur Mission: To reveal the raw reality of abandonment and the healing power of a second chance. Every video is designed to make you feel, reflect, and believe in kindness.\n\nYour takeaway is clear: Adopt, don’t abandon. Care changes destinies.\n\n🔔 Subscribe to join our mission. If you believe every animal deserves dignity and love, you belong here.\n\n#AnimalRescue #DogRescue #CatRescue #AdoptDontShop #EmotionalStories","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY-Zgb2m_iGyZrSxSfoj3Uw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY-Zgb2m_iGyZrSxSfoj3Uw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:25.884Z","channelId":"UCY-Zgb2m_iGyZrSxSfoj3Uw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"46695a44c87c089c9e1d3d90b5803f8eb369a1c986269590710b3e75749b1384","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"bcdd3bae138598135bd38f7f7aa7d43faecdaade9e2f342ec67c64e3f32f607d"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY-Zgb2m_iGyZrSxSfoj3Uw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:25.884Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY-Zgb2m_iGyZrSxSfoj3Uw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1160,"raw":"1.16K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY-Zgb2m_iGyZrSxSfoj3Uw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:25.884Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywor